name: ['Academy Manufactor', 'Access Tunnel', 'Aetherborn Marauder', 'Ancient Greenwarden', 'Angel of Indemnity', 'Angel of the Ruins', 'Angelic Sell-Sword', "Angrath's Marauders", 'Arcane Bombardment', 'Arcane Denial', 'Arcane Heist', 'Arcane Signet', 'Archmage Emeritus', 'Avenger of Zendikar', 'Back in Town', 'Baleful Mastery', 'Baleful Strix', "Baral's Expertise", 'Battlefield Forge', 'Big Score', 'Bitter Reunion', 'Blackcleave Cliffs', 'Bladegriff Prototype', 'Bloodthirsty Adversary', 'Bojuka Bog', "Bonders' Enclave", 'Boros Charm', 'Bounty Board', 'Brainstealer Dragon', 'Breena, the Demagogue', 'Cactus Preserve', 'Canyon Slough', 'Captain Lannery Storm', 'Captivating Crew', 'Cascade Bluffs', 'Cataclysmic Prospecting', 'Caves of Koilos', 'Cazur, Ruthless Stalker', 'Changeling Outcast', 'Chaos Wand', 'Chaos Warp', 'Charred Graverobber', 'Chromatic Lantern', 'Clifftop Retreat', 'Cold-Eyed Selkie', 'Command Beacon', 'Command Tower', "Council's Judgment", 'Crackling Spellslinger', 'Crawling Sensation', 'Culling Ritual', 'Cunning Rhetoric', 'Curse of the Swine', 'Cursed Mirror', "Curtains' Call", 'Darkslick Shores', 'Darksteel Ingot', 'Darkwater Catacombs', 'Dazzling Sphinx', 'Dead Before Sunrise', 'Deadly Dispute', 'Decimate', 'Deep Analysis', 'Demolition Field', 'Descend upon the Sinful', 'Desert of the Fervent', 'Desert of the Indomitable', 'Desert of the True', 'Desolate Mire', 'Dig Through Time', 'Diluvian Primordial', 'Dimir Aqueduct', 'Dire Fleet Daredevil', 'Dire Fleet Ravager', 'Discreet Retreat', 'Dragonskull Summit', "Dream-Thief's Bandana", 'Drowned Catacomb', 'Dune Chanter', 'Dunes of the Dead', 'Eccentric Farmer', 'Edric, Spymaster of Trest', 'Electric Revelation', 'Electrostatic Field', 'Elemental Eruption', 'Elvish Rejuvenator', 'Embrace the Unknown', 'Epic Experiment', 'Eris, Roar of the Storm', 'Escape to the Wilds', 'Evolving Wilds', 'Exotic Orchard', 'Explore', 'Expressive Iteration', 'Extract Brain', 'Fain, the Broker', 'Faithless Looting', 'Fall